# Brilliance Unleashed's "it's a 3/3 Robot artifact creature with flying" (CR 614.12) belongs to the object that entered: Bot1 returns Black Lotus as that Robot on turn 3 (the
# creature type, 3/3 and flying are there), then on turn 5 Ephemerate exiles and returns it. A card that changes zones is a new object (CR 400.7), so the Lotus comes back as the
# plain noncreature artifact it is printed as: no Robot, no power or toughness, no flying.

